/* Last Light - UI. Mobile first, grimy field-notebook look. */
:root {
  --bg: #0a0f0b;
  --panel: rgba(12, 18, 14, 0.82);
  --panel-2: rgba(18, 25, 19, 0.92);
  --line: rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.16);
  --line-strong: rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.3);
  --text: #e8e1cb;
  --muted: #9b9a85;
  --dim: #6f7163;
  --amber: #e3b361;
  --amber-2: #c78d41;
  --green: #8bb27c;
  --red: #c25b4a;
  --blue: #6f9aa8;
  --purple: #8d7fb4;
  --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  --mono: ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
  --serif: "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Palatino, Georgia, serif;
  --safe-b: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  --safe-t: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; height: 100%; }
body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--sans);
  overflow: hidden;
  height: 100dvh;
  touch-action: none;
  -webkit-user-select: none;
  user-select: none;
  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
  overscroll-behavior: none;
}
canvas#game { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; background: #131a16; }
.hidden { display: none !important; }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.tiny { font-size: 10px; }
.good { color: var(--green); }
.bad { color: #e27763; }
button, input, select { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
button { cursor: pointer; }
h1, h2, h3, p { margin: 0; }
ul { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ panels */
.panel {
  background: var(--panel);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(7px);
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------- HUD */
#hud { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 10; pointer-events: none; }
#hud button, #hud .minimap-wrap, #hud .prompt, #hud .build-bar { pointer-events: auto; }
.hud-top {
  position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  padding: calc(var(--safe-t) + 8px) 9px 0;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px;
}
.hud-left, .hud-right { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.hud-left { width: 172px; align-items: flex-start; }
.hud-right { width: 172px; align-items: flex-end; }

.clock-card { padding: 7px 9px 8px; width: 100%; }
.clock-main { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; }
#hud-time { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: #f2ead2; line-height: 1; }
.day-pill {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--amber);
  border: 1px solid rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.35); padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px;
}
.clock-sub {
  display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-top: 4px;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.04em;
}
.clock-sub span + span::before { content: "·"; margin-right: 6px; color: var(--dim); }
.location {
  margin-top: 5px; padding-top: 5px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #c9c2a9; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis;
}

.vitals { padding: 7px 8px; width: 100%; display: grid; gap: 4px; }
.vital { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 12px 1fr 24px; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.v-ico { font-size: 9px; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); filter: grayscale(0.2); }
.vital b { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; font-weight: 500; }
.bar { height: 5px; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
.bar i { display: block; height: 100%; width: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.25s linear; }
.bar.slim { height: 4px; margin-top: 4px; }
.vital[data-v="health"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8c3129, #c95848); }
.vital[data-v="stamina"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #8a6f2d, #d6b055); }
.vital[data-v="hunger"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7c5228, #bd8248); }
.vital[data-v="thirst"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #355d6b, #6da0b0); }
.vital[data-v="fatigue"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f4472, #8a7cbb); }
.vital[data-v="warmth"] .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #74372f, #c46f5e); }
.vital.low .bar i { animation: pulseBar 1.1s infinite; }
@keyframes pulseBar { 50% { filter: brightness(1.7); } }

.status-icons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 3px; width: 100%; }
.status-chip {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: 2px 4px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid rgba(194, 91, 74, 0.4);
  color: #e0a291; background: rgba(74, 24, 20, 0.55);
}
.status-chip.cold { border-color: rgba(111, 154, 168, 0.45); color: #a9cbd4; background: rgba(18, 40, 47, 0.6); }
.status-chip.ok { border-color: rgba(139, 178, 124, 0.35); color: #b9d3ad; background: rgba(24, 42, 24, 0.5); }

.minimap-wrap { position: relative; width: 138px; padding: 3px; border-radius: 9px; overflow: hidden; }
#minimap { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 6px; image-rendering: auto; }
.map-n {
  position: absolute; top: 6px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; color: rgba(238, 230, 206, 0.7); letter-spacing: 0.1em;
}
.top-buttons { display: flex; gap: 5px; }
.icon-btn {
  width: 51px; height: 44px; border-radius: 8px;
  background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 1px;
  font-size: 16px; line-height: 1; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
  backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
}
.icon-btn span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
.icon-btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); border-color: var(--line-strong); }

.quest-tracker { width: 100%; padding: 7px 8px; }
.quest-tracker h3 { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.quest-tracker li { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.35; color: #c6c0a9; padding: 2px 0; }
.quest-tracker li .qcheck { color: var(--dim); font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; }
.quest-tracker li.done { color: var(--dim); text-decoration: line-through; }
.quest-tracker li.done .qcheck { color: var(--green); }
.quest-tracker li .qdetail { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; color: var(--dim); white-space: nowrap; }

.prompt {
  position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 158px); transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 9, 0.85); border: 1px solid rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.35);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px 6px 6px;
  font-size: 11px; color: #ece5cf; white-space: nowrap; max-width: 82vw;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
}
.prompt .key {
  width: 21px; height: 21px; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: #17130b;
  background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.35);
}
.prompt.ready { animation: promptPulse 1.6s infinite; }
@keyframes promptPulse { 50% { border-color: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.75); } }

.toasts {
  position: absolute; top: calc(var(--safe-t) + 14px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; width: min(86vw, 420px); z-index: 24;
  pointer-events: none; align-items: center;
}
.toast {
  display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: flex-start;
  padding: 7px 11px; border-radius: 7px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.3;
  background: rgba(10, 15, 11, 0.93); border: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: #ded8c2; box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.45);
  animation: toastIn 0.22s ease-out;
}
.toast .ti { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.25; }
.toast.good { border-color: rgba(139, 178, 124, 0.38); }
.toast.good .ti { color: var(--green); }
.toast.warn { border-color: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.38); }
.toast.warn .ti { color: var(--amber); }
.toast.bad { border-color: rgba(194, 91, 74, 0.5); }
.toast.bad .ti { color: #e27763; }
.toast.out { animation: toastOut 0.4s forwards; }
@keyframes toastIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px) scale(.97); } }
@keyframes toastOut { to { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); } }

.build-bar {
  position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 150px); transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 8px;
  background: rgba(8, 13, 9, 0.92); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 178, 124, 0.45);
  border-radius: 9px; font-size: 11px; white-space: nowrap; z-index: 12;
}
#build-name { font-weight: 600; color: #cfe3c4; padding: 0 5px; }

.desktop-hints {
  position: absolute; left: 9px; bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 8px);
  display: flex; gap: 9px; flex-wrap: wrap; max-width: 520px;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: rgba(210, 205, 180, 0.5);
}
.desktop-hints b { color: rgba(232, 225, 203, 0.8); font-weight: 600; }

/* ----------------------------------------------------------- touch controls */
.touch-only { display: none; }
body.is-touch .touch-only { display: block; }
.touch-left {
  position: fixed; left: 14px; bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 12px); z-index: 14;
  pointer-events: auto; touch-action: none;
}
.joystick {
  position: relative; width: 118px; height: 118px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 35%, rgba(34, 45, 35, 0.8), rgba(8, 12, 9, 0.6));
  border: 1px solid rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.24);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,.5), 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  display: grid; place-items: center;
}
.joy-ring { position: absolute; width: 78%; height: 78%; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px dashed rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.15); }
.stick {
  width: 46px; height: 46px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 32%, #66705c, #333d33 65%, #222a22);
  border: 1px solid rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.24);
  box-shadow: 0 5px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.45), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  will-change: transform;
}
.touch-right {
  position: fixed; right: 10px; bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 10px); z-index: 14;
  display: none; grid-template-columns: 47px 47px 74px; grid-template-rows: 47px 56px 62px;
  gap: 5px; align-items: end; justify-items: end; pointer-events: none;
}
body.is-touch .touch-right { display: grid; }
.round {
  pointer-events: auto; border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid rgba(214, 201, 160, 0.24);
  background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 30%, rgba(54, 64, 50, 0.92), rgba(18, 24, 18, 0.9));
  box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.4), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 19px; color: #e7e0c9; line-height: 1; gap: 2px; touch-action: none;
}
.round span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.09em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.round:active, .round.active { background: radial-gradient(circle at 38% 30%, #8c6b34, #4a3519); border-color: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.7); transform: scale(0.96); }
.round.small { width: 43px; height: 43px; font-size: 16px; }
.round.action { width: 66px; height: 66px; font-size: 25px; }
#btn-sprint { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
#btn-crouch { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1; }
#btn-light { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 1; justify-self: center; }
#btn-interact { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2 / span 2; align-self: end; }
#btn-attack { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2 / span 2; width: 74px; height: 74px; align-self: end; }
#btn-interact.ready { border-color: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.8); box-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.22); }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ screens */
.screen { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 50; }
.modal-screen {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(3, 6, 4, 0.68);
  backdrop-filter: blur(5px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
  padding: 0;
}
.sheet {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #131b14, #0b110c 70%);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
  width: min(100%, 760px);
  max-height: 92dvh;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  box-shadow: 0 -20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.sheet.wide { width: min(100%, 960px); }
.sheet.tall { height: 92dvh; }
.sheet.narrow { width: min(100%, 460px); }
.sheet-head {
  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;
  padding: 13px 14px 11px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015); flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.sheet-head > div:first-child { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
.sheet-head h2 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.03em; color: #efe7d0; }
.sheet-head p { font-size: 10px; margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.35; }
.close {
  flex: 0 0 auto; width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(0,0,0,.25); color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 21px; line-height: 1; display: grid; place-items: center;
}
.close:active { background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); }
.sheet-body { padding: 13px 14px calc(16px + var(--safe-b)); overflow: auto; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 0; }
.sheet-body.scroll { -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
.sheet-foot {
  display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; padding: 11px 14px calc(12px + var(--safe-b));
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(0,0,0,.18); flex: 0 0 auto;
}
@media (min-width: 761px) {
  .modal-screen { align-items: center; padding: 24px; }
  .sheet { border-radius: 15px; max-height: 88vh; }
  .sheet.tall { height: auto; max-height: 88vh; }
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ buttons */
.btn {
  appearance: none; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(46, 56, 44, 0.9), rgba(22, 30, 23, 0.95));
  color: #e6dfc8; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 16px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.05);
  transition: filter .15s, transform .1s;
}
.btn:hover { filter: brightness(1.12); }
.btn:active { transform: translateY(1px); }
.btn.primary {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #d9a552, #a9762e);
  border-color: #e7c182; color: #171208;
  box-shadow: 0 6px 22px rgba(197, 143, 58, 0.28), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.25);
}
.btn.ghost { background: rgba(255,255,255,.03); border-color: var(--line); color: #c9c3ad; }
.btn.danger { color: #f0b3a7; border-color: rgba(194, 91, 74, 0.45); background: rgba(72, 24, 20, 0.4); }
.btn.large { padding: 12px 24px; font-size: 13px; }
.btn.wide { width: 100%; }
.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; filter: none; transform: none; }
.mini {
  border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  color: #ded7c1; border-radius: 5px; padding: 3px 7px; font-size: 9px; line-height: 1.2;
}
.mini.primary { background: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.16); border-color: rgba(227, 179, 97, 0.5); color: #f0d49a; }
.mini:disabled { opacity: .35; }
.stack-buttons { display: grid; gap: 7px; margin: 8px 0 14px; }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------- title */
.title-screen {
  background:
    radial-gradient(80% 60% at 70% 30%, rgba(97, 76, 37, 0.2), transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(90% 80% at 20% 90%, rgba(19, 44, 34, 0.55), transparent 70%),
    linear-gradient(145deg, #0b110c 0%, #0a0d09 55%, #070a07 100%);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden;
}
.title-screen::before {
  content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none;
  background-image:
    repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.016) 0 1px, transparent 1px 3px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, transparent 30%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%);
  opacity: .8;
}
.title-vignette {
  position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background: radial-gradient(60% 50% at 50% 42%, transparent 0%, rgba(2,4,3,.55) 100%);
}
.title-content {
  position: relative; z-index: 2; width: min(92vw, 760px); text-align: center;
  padding: 20px; animation: fadeUp .8s ease-out;
}
.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.24em;
  color: var(--amber); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.eyebrow.bad { color: #db7865; }
.eyebrow.good { color: var(--green); }
.title-content h1 {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  font-size: clamp(58px, 18vw, 140px); line-height: 0.82; color: #ede4c9;
  text-shadow: 0 10px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.65);
}
.title-content h1 span { display: block; color: var(--amber); font-style: italic; letter-spacing: 0.1em; }
.tagline {
  font-family: var(--serif); font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(13px, 3.2vw, 17px);
  color: #a6a58e; margin: 18px 0 28px;
}
.title-buttons { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.title-buttons .btn { width: min(280px, 78vw); }
.title-foot {
  margin-top: 30px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #6e7062;
}
#title-save-info:empty { display: none; }
#title-save-info { color: var(--amber-2); }
.title-side {
  position: absolute; right: 4vw; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
  display: none; width: 200px; color: #7f8170; font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; line-height: 1.9; text-align: right;
}
.title-side .side-line { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(227,179,97,.5)); margin-bottom: 12px; }
@keyframes fadeUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } }
@media (min-width: 900px) { .title-side { display: block; } }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ create */
.create-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
.create-grid section { min-width: 0; }
.field { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
.field > span { display: block; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 5px; text-transform: uppercase; }
.field input[type="text"], .field input:not([type]) {
  width: 100%; padding: 9px 11px; border-radius: 7px;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.32); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); color: var(--text);
  font-size: 14px; outline: none;
}
.field input:focus { border-color: rgba(227,179,97,.55); }
.profession-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
.prof-card {
  text-align: left; padding: 8px 9px; border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  display: flex; gap: 7px; align-items: flex-start; min-height: 52px;
}
.prof-card .pi { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.1; }
.prof-card .pn { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #ddd6bf; }
.prof-card .pb { display: none; font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 2px; }
.prof-card.active { border-color: rgba(227,179,97,.65); background: rgba(227,179,97,.1); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(227,179,97,.2) inset; }
.prof-card.active .pn { color: #f0d49a; }
@media (min-width: 620px) { .prof-card .pb { display: block; } .profession-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
.seg { display: flex; gap: 4px; padding: 3px; background: rgba(0,0,0,.3); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; }
.seg button { flex: 1; padding: 7px 4px; border-radius: 6px; border: 0; background: transparent; font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); }
.seg button.active { background: rgba(227,179,97,.16); color: #f0d49a; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(227,179,97,.35); }
.info-panel { padding: 10px 11px; margin-bottom: 9px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
.info-panel h3 { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .14em; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.info-panel p { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--muted); }
.info-panel .perk { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 10px; color: #cfc7a9; line-height: 1.4; }
.check-list { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.55; color: #a8a690; display: grid; gap: 3px; }
.check-list li { position: relative; padding-left: 11px; }
.check-list li::before { content: "·"; position: absolute; left: 2px; color: var(--amber); }
@media (min-width: 700px) { .create-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; } }

/* -------------------------------------------------------------------- tabs */
.tabs { display: flex; gap: 2px; padding: 6px 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); overflow-x: auto; flex: 0 0 auto; scrollbar-width: none; }
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.tabs button {
  border: 0; background: transparent; color: var(--muted);
  padding: 7px 10px 8px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .03em;
  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; white-space: nowrap;
}
.tabs button.active { color: #f0d49a; border-bottom-color: var(--amber); }
.weight-box { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 110px; text-align: right; }
.weight-box span { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--muted); }
#inv-weight-bar { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6f7f58, #c8b56d); }

/* --------------------------------------------------------------- item lists */
.item-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
.item-row {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 8px 9px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.025); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
  min-height: 46px;
}
.item-row .item-icon {
  flex: 0 0 auto; width: 31px; height: 31px; border-radius: 7px; display: grid; place-items: center;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05); font-size: 17px;
}
.item-main { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; }
.item-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #e2dbc4; display: flex; gap: 5px; align-items: baseline; }
.item-name .qty { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; color: var(--amber); }
.item-meta { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 2px; display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.item-meta .cond { color: #a8b894; }
.item-actions { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.item-actions .mini { min-width: 38px; padding: 5px 6px; }
.empty { padding: 22px 10px; text-align: center; font-size: 11px; color: var(--dim); font-family: var(--mono); letter-spacing: .05em; }
.section-title { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--amber); margin: 14px 0 7px; }
.section-title:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

.equip-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 6px; }
.equip-slot { padding: 8px 9px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); min-height: 58px; }
.equip-slot .slot-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--dim); text-transform: uppercase; }
.equip-slot .slot-item { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #ddd6bf; }
.equip-slot .slot-item span { font-size: 16px; }
.equip-slot .slot-empty { margin-top: 7px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--dim); font-style: italic; }
.equip-slot .mini { margin-top: 5px; }
.stat-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 10px; padding: 4px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04); color: #b3b09a; }
.stat-line b { color: #e3dcc5; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 500; }

.recipe {
  padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.022); display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: flex-start;
}
.recipe + .recipe { margin-top: 5px; }
.recipe .r-icon { font-size: 20px; width: 28px; text-align: center; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.recipe .r-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.recipe .r-name { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: #e3dcc5; display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; }
.recipe .r-desc { font-size: 9px; color: var(--dim); margin-top: 2px; line-height: 1.35; }
.recipe .r-cost { display: flex; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 5px; }
.chip {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line); color: #b5b29b; background: rgba(0,0,0,.22);
}
.chip.miss { color: #d98b7b; border-color: rgba(194,91,74,.35); }
.chip.req { color: #c9bd8d; border-color: rgba(227,179,97,.3); }
.recipe .r-action { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: flex-end; }
.recipe .r-reason { font-size: 8px; color: #d98b7b; max-width: 105px; text-align: right; line-height: 1.25; }

.skill-row { padding: 5px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04); }
.skill-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; font-size: 10px; color: #c9c4ad; }
.skill-top b { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 9px; color: var(--amber); }
.skill-row .bar { height: 4px; margin-top: 3px; }
.skill-row .bar i { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6f7f58, #c8b56d); }

.objective { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 7px; padding: 6px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04); font-size: 10px; }
.objective .oc { font-family: var(--mono); color: var(--dim); }
.objective.done { color: var(--dim); text-decoration: line-through; }
.objective.done .oc { color: var(--green); }
.objective .od { margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; color: var(--dim); text-align: right; }

/* -------------------------------------------------------------------- loot */
.loot-sheet .sheet-body { display: flex; }
.loot-cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; flex: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: hidden; }
.loot-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 0; padding: 10px 12px 0; }
.loot-col + .loot-col { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.loot-col h3 {
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .15em; color: var(--amber);
  text-transform: uppercase; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 6px; flex: 0 0 auto;
}
.loot-col .item-list { overflow: auto; padding-bottom: 12px; min-height: 0; flex: 1; }
.loot-cols { overflow: auto; }
@media (min-width: 761px) {
  .loot-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; overflow: hidden; }
  .loot-col + .loot-col { border-top: 0; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .loot-col { padding-bottom: 12px; }
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------------------- map */
.map-sheet .sheet-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.map-wrap { flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 10px; }
#world-map { width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 64vh; object-fit: contain; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #10160f; touch-action: manipulation; }
.map-hint { font-size: 9px; color: var(--dim); text-align: center; padding: 0 12px calc(10px + var(--safe-b)); font-family: var(--mono); }

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------- sleep */
.sleep-buttons { display: grid; gap: 7px; }

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- settings */
.row-setting {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;
  padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05); font-size: 11px; color: #c7c1ab;
}
.row-setting input[type="checkbox"] { width: 38px; height: 22px; appearance: none; background: rgba(0,0,0,.4); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; position: relative; transition: background .15s; }
.row-setting input[type="checkbox"]::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #7b7f6d; transition: transform .15s, background .15s; }
.row-setting input[type="checkbox"]:checked { background: rgba(227,179,97,.25); }
.row-setting input[type="checkbox"]:checked::after { transform: translateX(16px); background: var(--amber); }
.row-setting input[type="range"] { width: 130px; accent-color: var(--amber); }
.row-setting select { background: rgba(0,0,0,.35); border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 6px; padding: 5px 7px; font-size: 10px; }

/* -------------------------------------------------------------------- help */
.help-body .help-grid { display: grid; gap: 8px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
.help-grid > div { font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.55; color: #a8a690; padding: 9px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.02); }
.help-grid b { color: #ddd6bf; }

/* -------------------------------------------------------------------- ends */
.end-screen {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 10%, rgba(120, 32, 24, 0.16), transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(80% 80% at 50% 100%, rgba(9, 20, 12, 0.9), transparent 70%),
    rgba(3, 6, 4, 0.92);
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  padding: 20px; overflow: hidden;
}
.end-screen.victory { background: radial-gradient(70% 60% at 50% 10%, rgba(92, 132, 76, 0.16), transparent 70%), rgba(3, 6, 4, 0.93); }
.end-card { width: min(94vw, 620px); text-align: center; animation: fadeUp .5s ease-out; }
.end-card h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(30px, 8vw, 58px); line-height: 0.95; letter-spacing: .04em; color: #ece3c8; margin: 4px 0 12px; }
.end-card p { font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.5; }
.end-stats {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 5px;
  margin: 22px 0 20px; text-align: left;
}
.end-stats .es {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; padding: 7px 9px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted);
}
.end-stats .es b { color: #e1dac2; font-family: var(--mono); font-weight: 500; }
.end-card .title-buttons .btn { width: min(260px, 76vw); }
.noscript { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; background: #0a0f0b; z-index: 999; font-size: 16px; }

/* --------------------------------------------------------------- responsive */
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .hud-left { width: 152px; }
  .hud-right { width: 146px; }
  .minimap-wrap { width: 118px; }
  .icon-btn { width: 44px; height: 40px; font-size: 14px; }
  .icon-btn span { font-size: 6px; }
  .quest-tracker { padding: 6px 7px; }
  .quest-tracker li { font-size: 7.5px; }
  #hud-time { font-size: 19px; }
  .vitals { padding: 6px 7px; gap: 3px; }
  .vital { grid-template-columns: 11px 1fr 21px; }
  .vital b { font-size: 7px; }
  .prompt { bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 146px); font-size: 10px; }
  .build-bar { bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 140px); }
  .sheet-head h2 { font-size: 18px; }
  .sheet-body { padding: 11px 12px calc(14px + var(--safe-b)); }
  .equip-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .end-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
}
@media (max-height: 620px) and (max-width: 900px) {
  .quest-tracker { display: none; }
  .vitals { gap: 2px; }
  .vital { grid-template-columns: 11px 1fr 20px; }
  .clock-sub .weather-extra { display: none; }
  .minimap-wrap { width: 108px; }
  .touch-left { bottom: calc(var(--safe-b) + 6px); }
  .joystick { width: 104px; height: 104px; }
  .stick { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
  .touch-right { grid-template-columns: 42px 42px 66px; grid-template-rows: 42px 50px 56px; }
  .round.action { width: 60px; height: 60px; font-size: 22px; }
  #btn-attack { width: 66px; height: 66px; }
}
@media (min-width: 900px) {
  .hud-left { width: 200px; }
  .hud-right { width: 200px; }
  .minimap-wrap { width: 164px; }
  .vitals { gap: 5px; }
  .vital { grid-template-columns: 13px 1fr 26px; }
  .vital b { font-size: 9px; }
  .quest-tracker li { font-size: 9px; }
  .desktop-hints { font-size: 9px; }
}
@media (hover: none) {
  .desktop-hints { display: none; }
}

content.text:
Now ui.js. Need to be careful and complete.

Let me draft class UI with methods.

Constructor:
```
import { PROFESSIONS, DIFFICULTIES, ITEMS, RECIPES, BUILD_RECIPES, SKILLS, BUILDINGS } from './config.js';
import { formatClock, timeOfDayName } from './utils.js';

const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);
const esc = ...

export class UI {
 constructor(game, renderer){
  this.game=game; this.renderer=renderer;
  this.screens={...};
  this.currentScreen=null;
  this.selectedProfession='survivor'; this.selectedDifficulty='normal';
  this.tab='items';
  this.lootContainer=null;
  this.attackHeld=false;
  this.joyPointer=null;
  this.minimapT=0; this.saveInfoT=0;
  this.buildSelected=null;
  this.abandonArmed=false;
  this.bind();
  this.buildCreate();
  this.buildHelp? static
 }
```
DOM refs: title, create, inventory, loot, map, pause, help, sleep, death, victory, hud.

start():
```
document.body.classList.toggle('is-touch', game.isTouch);
this.sound apply;
this.showTitle();
this.renderProfession();
requestAnimationFrame(this.tick? no, game loop calls frame)
```
But game loop only calls ui.frame when world exists. Title UI doesn't need frame. save info updated showTitle.

bind():
- `document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]')` -> click => this.closeScreen(this.currentScreen) (close nearest screen) — since data-close inside screen; use closest('.screen').
- title buttons.
- create start.
- HUD buttons `[data-open]`.
- minimap wrap click -> openMap.
- touch buttons.
- joystick.
- tabs.
- pause buttons.
- sleep buttons.
- death/victory.
- keyboard global.
- map canvas click.
- window resize? no.
- prevent double tap zoom? CSS viewport.

Open/close screen:
```
openScreen(name){
 const el=this.screens[name]; if(!el)return;
 // close others except maybe
 for (const [k,node] of Object.entries(this.screens)) if(k!==name) node.classList.add('hidden');
 el.classList.remove('hidden');
 this.currentScreen=name;
 if(name!=='inventory'&&... )? 
 game.inputLocked=true; game.paused=true; game.sound.click();
}
closeScreen(name=this.currentScreen){
 if(!name) return;
 this.screens[name]?.classList.add('hidden');
 this.currentScreen=null;
 // Hide title? title handled separately
 if(this.game.state==='playing'){ this.game.inputLocked=false; this.game.paused=false; }
 if(name==='loot') this.lootContainer=null;
}
closeAll(){ for all screens add hidden; currentScreen=null; if playing unpause; }
```
But showTitle uses screen-title and should not be considered modal for unpausing. Title is separate; handle manually.

Title isn't opened via openScreen; use showTitle directly.

For inventory closing via data-close, closeScreen('inventory').

When opening loot, UI sets game paused; on close unpause if state playing.

onDeath: hide other screens; show death screen; update stats; game.paused=true (state dead so update skips anyway); hud maybe still visible behind overlay. Fine.

onVictory similar.

enterGame:
- hide title/create/death/victory/help etc all screens
- hud show
- closeAll but don't set unpause? closeAll then set game.paused=false inputLocked=false
- update HUD immediately
- if game.isTouch show touch.

Frame:
```
if(game.state!=='playing') return; // but build bar etc
this.updateHUD();
this.updateMinimap(dt);
this.updatePrompt();
this.updateQuestTracker maybe every 0.25 (call updateHUD)
if(this.attackHeld && !game.buildMode) game.attack();
if(this.game.buildMode) show build bar and text.
if sprint/crouch toggles update classes.
```
Since frame called at 10fps.

HUD:
```
const p=game.player; if(!p)return;
const {time}=formatClock(game.hour, game.day);
$hud-time textContent = time;
day = `DAY ${game.day}`;
phase = timeOfDayName(game.hour);
temp = game.temperature() + '°C';
weather=game.weatherName();
location=game.world.locationName(p.x,p.y);
vitals mapping; value; bar width; text rounded; parent low if < 25 (health<30 etc). For fatigue and hunger low thresholds: hunger<25, thirst<25, health<30, stamina<20, fatigue>80, warmth<25 (invert).
status icons: build chips:
 bleeding>0 → BLEEDING; infection>20 → INFECTED; fracture → FRACTURE; pain>35 → IN PAIN; warmth<30 → COLD; hunger<20 STARVING; thirst<20 DEHYDRATED; in building safe? "SHELTERED" if buildingInside; near heat "WARM" maybe.
```
Use innerHTML string.

Weight etc only in modals.

Minimap: every 0.25s drawMinimap. Also draw buildMode indicator? renderer minimap no. Fine.

Prompt:
```
const it=game.nearestInteract;
if(it && !game.buildMode){ label; show; prompt.classList.add('ready'); interact button add ready; key text = game.isTouch?'✋':'E'; }
else hide + remove ready.
```
When game.buildMode, prompt hidden and buildbar visible.

Quest tracker:
```
const ul=...; ul.innerHTML=game.objectives().map(o=>`<li class="${o.done?'done':''}"><span class="qcheck">${o.done?'✓':'○'}</span><span>${esc(o.text)}</span><span class="qdetail">${esc(o.detail)}</span></li>`).join('');
```
Update every frame 10fps innerHTML churn. Fine but maybe costly; gate every 0.5s with this.questT. Do in updateHUD only if changed signature. Compute sig; cache.
Similarly status icons sig.

`formatClock` returns time/day; day param unused; fine.

Toasts:
```
toast(text,type='info',ms=3200){
 const box=$toasts; const el=document.createElement('div'); el.className='toast '+type;
 const icons={good:'✓',bad:'!',warn:'▲',info:'◆'};
 el.innerHTML=`<span class="ti">${icon}</span><span>${esc(text)}</span>`;
 box.appendChild(el);
 while(box.children.length>4) box.removeChild(box.firstChild);
 setTimeout(()=>{el.classList.add('out'); setTimeout(()=>el.remove(),420);}, ms);
}
```
Note game.notify calls ui.toast. Avoid using innerHTML on user text (escaped).

BuildCreate:
- render profession list buttons with selected; clicking sets selected and updates info; difficulty.
- `#create-start` click: name input value; game.newGame({name,profession,difficulty}); 
- `#btn-new` showCreate; `#btn-quick` game.newGame(default).
- continue: if !game.load() toast; else... load handles.
- showTitle updates save info:
```
const raw = localStorage.getItem('lastlight.save.v1'); parse; profile, totalHours, day; text `Save: Name, Day X` 
```
hasSave; continue hidden toggle.
- showCreate reset.

Inventory:
```
openInventory(tab=this.tab){ this.tab=tab; this.renderInventory(); openScreen('inventory'); }
renderInventory(){
 update title/sub/weight; tabs active; body innerHTML based on tab;
 bind item action buttons via event delegation on inv-body (bind once in bind())
}
```
Use event delegation: `inv-body.addEventListener('click', e=>{ const btn=e.target.closest('[data-act]'); if(!btn)return; const act=btn.dataset.act; const idx=Number(btn.dataset.idx); ... })`. Since DOM re-rendered, delegation works.

For inventory entries use index into game.inventory (current order). Buttons `data-act="use|equip|drop"` `data-idx`.
When re-render after action, indices update.

Render items:
```
if(!game.inventory.length) empty.
for each entry idx:
 def; category label;
 cond = entry.dur!=null && def.dur? `${Math.round(entry.dur/def.dur*100)}%` : '';
 weight total;
 primaryLabel = def.equip? (def.equip==='weapon' && game.equipped.weapon?.id===entry.id? ... ) : def.use?'Use':null
```
Since equipped items removed from inventory, def.equip always Equip.

`data-act` primary: for equip 'equip', use 'use'. Both call game.equip/use. Simpler action 'primary'.

Item row actions: primary, drop. Also maybe `Store` not here.

Equipment tab:
```
slots order weapon,light,backpack,armor
for each: def of equipped or empty; button unequip data-slot.
stats: weight, capacity, armor %, warmth, weapon damage, light dur.
```
Armor from def.armor.
Weapon summary from game.getWeapon(); dur.
Light.

Craft tab:
```
for each RECIPES:
 chk=game.canCraft(r)
 cost chips with have>=need
 skill req chip
 button data-craft="id" disabled !chk.ok; reason title.
```
If heat station, show "🔥 station" chip.
delegation `[data-craft]` on inv-body → game.craft(recipe); render.

Build tab:
```
for each BUILD_RECIPES: chk=game.canBuild; cost= game.buildCost(r); chips based on count; button data-build disabled.
```
Click: startBuild -> if success closeScreen('inventory') -> unpause; build bar shows via frame.
Need closeScreen doesn't reset buildMode. UI.setBuildMode(true, recipe) called by game.startBuild; sets buildbar visible/manual. Frame also handles.

Status tab:
- condition summary, skills, objectives, stats, current effects.
```
<h3 class=section-title>CONDITION</h3>
stat lines: Health, Pain, Bleeding, Infection, Fracture, Warmth, Stress
conditions chips.
skills
objectives
run stats: kills, containers, distance m? stats.distance tiles *? 1 tile=2m maybe. Show `${Math.round(distance)} m` if 1 tile=1m? spec 128 tiles ~256m so 2m/tile. use *2.
```

Loot:
